{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18872","headline":"平蔡州三首 一 · 刘禹锡","name":"平蔡州三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔡州城中衆心死，妖星夜落照壕水。\n汉家飞将下天来，马箠一挥门洞开。\n贼徒崩腾望旗拜，有若羣蛰惊春雷。\n狂童面缚登槛车，太白夭矫垂捷书。\n相公从容来镇抚，常侍郊迎负文弩。\n四人归业闾里闲，小儿跳浪健儿舞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}